  basis: Some("x: mean-method degree-days from sowing, base 8.3 C. Shoot means leaf + stem (the paper does not separate them)."),
  method: "Evaluated from the published logistic fit Y = a/(1+exp(-b(x-c))) in Table 2 (a 2.415, b 0.03874, c 272.38; R2 0.9), every 50 Cd and at R8; not measured points (the weekly data are in Fig. 4 only)",
